strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;今天的《Tech In Depth》&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;中报道称，苹果公司的 iPhone Duo 将于周五上市，这表明智能手机业务已不再处于过去几年的旧迭代周期中。尽管可折叠手机已经上市多年，但没有一家公司能够像苹果这样的新企业激发开发人员的兴趣和努力。他写道，高价 Duo 的推出，再加上内存成本的上涨，可能会挤出预算模型，很可能会开启这些设备的新时代。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt; &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/rA8gwaGJ1hxkVR-sK2goredIZjZYL8uvkxDyesn3PEFi1k2rfZa0u6UkkNoVhWoik2OpMVlUfbGKEjo375BcWk3SkugfSesYtV6bYc-BCH-uHMf-F6gIW88fb5l_EzKfsEMDCHqTkgKQOsH4bC14PsSkeRDTrd83AZLqkhCrKrvQXsmyP3nABzUqNNklep6h7ZJHPDxzxY3iBZ7s8vzBFu7jd8acVcaUjbcEVnoQPUq1OS7DJaz7qEDIUsFLN-d000yLWc1h5V4eSUEhicc4wH0MwB6PcY3FqtnrmyKs4m3UIEFBVt_KsPTjx26P8laL6fzXfP90h4JJZKMX1bMnaNEqfvnpRVfwWCx5V6VzAsTRQVSCXvOaUqA8qmFikPVwIa-jAIM4BYgovK8wSKnG6mnPK0YS6DSDYz8uf-IxHyomYTgS9LKR3RuGQMBJd6C7FLhAO-kYVxTaQuHsYjFqtTi-wqawR9PBl1RUfZWrs10/bE2PHyTScFsZTEuLAdH7BVzY33_k08n2/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="技术深度"&gt;&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;获取《Tech In Depth》时事通讯&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;，了解彭博社世界各地记者对技术业务的分析和独家报道。&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 40px;"&gt;本周网络公告&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;乔丹·罗伯逊 (Jordan Robertson) 在&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/9JeV1sz9_yv0lGg7ShmSdQAvFy9z_BXstCHqdSNXyrB9B2COeSy8nfuAkF7rgXxg6eutigLaEmdttA1cNCYlDlFKnaIz5Y_J9mwKmTN0Kt7LAHNcOFgTF_yDMXRdFtAF6UiVwdZmkH0PZ-ChSndOj42t3NXWfByOfjgQY_gO4NetUWAxRulmb_V-w5mmdMt53aoc-UOBv0oF8THH1vFjvXOnsrcxLC0MyABZgFAfWeymyCa2IzTMV9eZogaw8Nlqpsvuq1p-bHKlzaD7SqbcMd3ZyW-d7jSXGkeFSOd4tpZZV7sr1aOd_Y5dQOsZRmJKF3Ynrj3TXZUNaWaFyEpJgO1Ag9jnzOC4rU_K_xB8_CAiFt4ZtOLmtL43ci-wxr94Usthr45ztGKpWWqkF_lgpkNht2rGeVsAPH1CcvgqGGpjEsDoRq5JXYFTH8zlULBT8w3M8iUYEGFRh7m5EZ_Rf3sUuzTL--f38MilftNrS-9UQ7auP7YG9Ykbv946VRL52bkqeBo40F_YNpHunGmJkp_C3zpnr22afOeaaTnkNS0aZik6/OtWnDmCeIZaFj6w7r6vxhcvH6